  "about": {
    "sectionNum": "01",
    "paragraphs": [
      "An AI &amp; ML engineer drawn equally to product development and research , I like taking an idea from a rough hypothesis all the way to a system people actually use, and I like sitting with the harder, slower questions underneath it.",
      "On the product side, that means designing intelligent agents, shipping end-to-end GenAI workflows, and building the backend systems and APIs that hold them together in production. On the research side, it means digging into why models generalize (or don't) across domains, and how interpretable a learned model can really be made.",
      "That mix , building fast and questioning deeply , is what I look for in any project, and what led me from a diploma in embedded systems, through a B.E. in Computer Science (AI &amp; ML), to an MTech in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Data Science, a joint programme between IIITDM and the University of Agder in Grimstad, Norway."
    ]
  },
