        "desc": "A RAG-based chatbot for document Q&amp;A and video-lecture interaction, built with LangChain, vLLM, and transformers, with multi-cloud deployment across Azure, AWS, Render, and Vercel.",
        "detail": [
          "EduBot is a retrieval-augmented chatbot that helps students interact with university resources , answering questions grounded in uploaded documents and letting them query video lectures directly.",
